{"id": 3203, "title": "Know and Achieve", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "know-and-achieve", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/3203_know-and-achieve.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["有一次，美国通用电气首席执行官杰克·韦尔奇应邀来中国给企业管理人员讲课。然而，听完课，很多人却感到很失望。他们问杰克·韦尔奇：\"您讲的那些内容，我们也差不多知道，可是为什么我们之间的差距会那么大呢？”杰克·韦尔奇回答：\"那是因为你们只是知道，而我却做到了，这就是我们的差别。”", "从\"知道”到\"做到”，需要付诸行动，克服种种困难。很多人尽管\"知道”却无法\"做到”，原因大致有两个：一个是缺乏吃苦耐劳的精神，不能坚持到最后；另一个就是停留在\"知道”的空谈，光说不做。", "不去尝试，不去坚持，即使\"知道”，最终成功也只能是一种空谈。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["有一次，美國通用電氣首席執行官傑克·韋爾奇應邀來中國給企業管理人員講課。然而，聽完課，很多人卻感到很失望。他們問傑克·韋爾奇：\"您講的那些內容，我們也差不多知道，可是為什麼我們之間的差距會那麼大呢？”傑克·韋爾奇回答：\"那是因為你們只是知道，而我卻做到了，這就是我們的差別。”", "從\"知道”到\"做到”，需要付諸行動，克服種種困難。很多人儘管\"知道”卻無法\"做到”，原因大致有兩個：一個是缺乏吃苦耐勞的精神，不能堅持到最後；另一個就是停留在\"知道”的空談，光說不做。", "不去嘗試，不去堅持，即使\"知道”，最終成功也只能是一種空談。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yǒu yī cì， Měi guó Tōng yòng diàn qì shǒu xí zhí xíng guān Jié kè Wéerqi yìng yāo lái Zhōng guó gěi qǐ yè guǎn lǐ rén yuán jiǎng kè。 rán ér， tīng wán kè， hěn duō rén què gǎn dào hěn shī wàng。 tā men wèn Jié kè Wéerqi：\" nín jiǎng de nà xiē nèi róng， wǒ men yě chà bu duō zhī dào， kě shì wèi shén me wǒ men zhī jiān de chā jù huì nà me dà ne？” Jié kè Wéerqi huí dá：\" nà shì yīn wèi nǐ men zhǐ shì zhī dào， ér wǒ què zuò dào le， zhè jiù shì wǒ men de chā bié。”", "cóng \" zhī dào” dào \" zuò dào”， xū yào fù zhū xíng dòng， kè fú zhǒng zhǒng kùn nan。 hěn duō rén jǐn guǎn \" zhī dào” què wú fǎ \" zuò dào”， yuán yīn dà zhì yǒu liǎng gè： yī gè shì quē fá chī kǔ nài láo de jīng shén， bù néng jiān chí dào zuì hòu； lìng yī gè jiù shì tíng liú zài \" zhī dào” de kōng tán， guāng shuō bù zuò。", "bù qù cháng shì， bù qù jiān chí， jí shǐ \" zhī dào”， zuì zhōng chéng gōng yě zhǐ néng shì yī zhǒng kōng tán。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Once, Jack Welch, the CEO of General Electric, was invited to China to speak to business managers. But after his talk, many of them felt disappointed. They asked him, “We already know most of what you told us, so why is the gap between us so large?” Welch replied, “Because you only know what to do, while I have actually done it. That’s the difference between us.”", "To go from knowing to doing, you have to take action and overcome all kinds of difficulties. There are roughly two reasons why many people know what to do but fail to do it: some lack the willingness to work hard and cannot see things through to the end; others stop at talking about what they know and never act.", "If you never try and never keep at it, then even if you know what to do, success will remain nothing more than talk."], "english_full": "Once, Jack Welch, the CEO of General Electric, was invited to China to speak to business managers. But after his talk, many of them felt disappointed. They asked him, “We already know most of what you told us, so why is the gap between us so large?” Welch replied, “Because you only know what to do, while I have actually done it. That’s the difference between us.”\n\nTo go from knowing to doing, you have to take action and overcome all kinds of difficulties. There are roughly two reasons why many people know what to do but fail to do it: some lack the willingness to work hard and cannot see things through to the end; others stop at talking about what they know and never act.\n\nIf you never try and never keep at it, then even if you know what to do, success will remain nothing more than talk.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cì\" data-defn=\"classifier for enumerated events: time\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Měi guó\" data-defn=\"United States; USA; US\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">美国</span><span class=\"tr\">美國</span><rt>Měi guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Tōng yòng\" data-defn=\"General Motors\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">通用</span><span class=\"tr\">通用</span><rt>Tōng yòng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"diàn qì\" data-defn=\"electric / electrical\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">电气</span><span class=\"tr\">電氣</span><rt>diàn qì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shǒu xí zhí xíng guān\" data-defn=\"chief executive officer (CEO)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">首席执行官</span><span class=\"tr\">首席執行官</span><rt>shǒu xí zhí xíng guān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Jié kè Wéerqi\" data-defn=\"Jack Welch (1935–2020), former CEO of General Electric, known for business management lectures and leadership practices.\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">杰克·韦尔奇</span><span class=\"tr\">傑克·韋爾奇</span><rt>Jié kè Wéerqi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yìng yāo\" data-defn=\"at sb&#x27;s invitation / on invitation\" data-hsk=\"HSK 6\"><span class=\"si\">应邀</span><span class=\"tr\">應邀</span><rt>yìng yāo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng guó\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gěi\" data-defn=\"to / for / for the benefit of / to do sth (for sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qǐ yè\" data-defn=\"company; firm; enterprise; corporation\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">企业</span><span class=\"tr\">企業</span><rt>qǐ yè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guǎn lǐ\" data-defn=\"management / administration\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si